{"3924400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eel Game", "steam_appid": 3924400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eel Game</strong> throws you into a chaotic survival competition where every round brings something different. Face off against other players in a series of random mini-games, some skill-based, some pure luck, all unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/707085bf0d6f34f232612d328d8ba8e7.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/707085bf0d6f34f232612d328d8ba8e7.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/707085bf0d6f34f232612d328d8ba8e7.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what’s coming next: one minute you’re staying perfectly still under pressure, the next you’re racing for your life or solving puzzles with a ticking clock. Every match is unpredictable, and that’s exactly the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/aed8478c3e9b90d1fc140d10e24952b0.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/aed8478c3e9b90d1fc140d10e24952b0.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/aed8478c3e9b90d1fc140d10e24952b0.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about being fast or smart—it’s about staying calm when everything (and everyone) is trying to mess you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust no one.</strong> Especially not the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=598 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules? Simple. Survive the game. Don’t get eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prize? Making it to the end… and maybe something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=780 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eel Game</strong> t