ng (and everyone) is trying to mess you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust no one.</strong> Especially not the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=598 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/bc5485e573e22c12c6c8d28c4a5a3b63.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules? Simple. Survive the game. Don’t get eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prize? Making it to the end… and maybe something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1755178182\" width=780 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924400/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1755178182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Play dangerous games and try to survive. Only one player can win. Will it be you?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages 